<title>HONG KONG: Fannie Mae to launch sterling global bond.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to launch sterling global bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae will launch an inaugural global bond denominated in pounds sterling, bookrunner Merrill Lynch International said on Monday.</p>
<p>The size, maturity and pricing will be determined after discussions with investors in Europe, Asia and the United States, Merrill said in a statement in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The other bookrunner is BZW.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
